OL,3,GNEWSA'Secret' location of city's Banksy
OL,4,Awork revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural by elusive artist Banksy that
OL,7,Fwas removed from a Hull bridge more
OL,8,Fthan seven years ago is being kept in
OL,9,Fstorage more than 120 miles away - and
OL,10,Fofficials have yet to confirm when it
OL,11,Fwill return.
OL,13,FThe work appeared on Scott Street
OL,14,FBridge, which spanned the River Hull,
OL,15,Fin January 2018. It was removed prior
OL,16,Fto the bridge being demolished in 2019.
OL,18,FNow it has emerged the artwork, which
OL,19,Fhas not been seen in public since, is
OL,20,Fbeing stored in Norfolk, according to a
OL,21,FHull City Council tender notice.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
